 *(Delivery_person_Age, Delivery_person_Ratings, Distance)*\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Data Preprocessing Steps\n","\n","### Data Cleaning\n","- Removed rows with **zero coordinate values** (invalid locations)\n","- Capped delivery person ratings at **5.0**\n","- Checked for duplicate records *(none found)*\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Feature Engineering\n","\n","#### a) Distance Calculation\n","- Used the **Haversine formula** to compute great-circle distance\n","- Earth radius assumed: **6367 km**\n","- Accounts for Earth’s curvature\n","- Produces accurate real-world travel distance\n","\n","---\n","\n","#### b) Feature Scaling\n","- Applied **PowerTransformer (Yeo–Johnson method)** to:\n","  - Delivery_person_Age\n","  - Delivery_person_Ratings\n","  - Distance\n","\n","**Why Yeo–Johnson?**\n","- Handles both positive and negative values\n","- Reduces skewness\n","- Standardizes variance\n","- Improves convergence of ML algorithms\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Train–Test Split\n","- **Training set:** 80% → 33,562 samples  \n","- **Testing set:** 20% → 8,391 samples  \n","- Stratified split on delivery time to preserve distribution\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Machine Learning Models Implemented\n","\n","| # | Model | Description |\n","|--|------|------------|\n","| 1 | Linear Regression | Baseline linear model |\n","| 2 | Lasso Regression | L1 regularization (α = 0.01) |\n","| 3 | Ridge Regression | L2 regularization |\n","| 4 | Decision Tree | max_depth = 10 |\n","| 5 | Random Forest | n_estimators = 300, max_depth = 10 |\n","| 6 | Gradient Boosting | n_estimators = 300, max_depth = 4, lr = 0.05 |\n","| 7 | XGBoost | n_estimators = 500, max_depth = 6, lr = 0.05 |\n","| 8 | LightGBM | n_estimators = 500, lr = 0.05 |\n","| 9 | CatBoost | iterations = 1000, depth = 6, lr = 0.05 |\n","|10 | Extra Trees | n_estimators = 300, max_depth = 10 |\n","|11 | Voting Regressor | RF + GB + XGBoost ensemble |\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Model Evaluation Metrics\n","\n","| Metric | Description |\n","|------|------------|\n","| **R² Score** | Proportion of variance explained |\n","| **MSE** | Mean Squared Error |\n","| **RMSE** | Root Mean Squared Error (minutes) |\n","| **RSS** | Residual Sum of Squares |\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Results and Analysis\n","\n","### Model Performance (Test Set)\n","\n","| Model | R² | RMSE (min) |\n","|------|----|-----------|\n","| **Gradient Boosting** | **0.3790** | **7.39** |\n","| Voting Regressor | 0.3769 | 7.40 |\n","| Random Forest | 0.3740 | 7.42 |\n","| CatBoost | 0.3749 | 7.41 |\n","| Extra Trees | 0.3745 | 7.42 |\n","| LightGBM | 0.3689 | 7.45 |\n","| XGBoost | 0.3651 | 7.47 |\n","| Decision Tree | 0.3498 | 7.56 |\n","| Linear Regression | 0.2367 | 8.19 |\n","| Lasso Regression | 0.2367 | 8.19 |\n","\n","### Key Observation\n","Gradient boosting–based models consistently outperform linear models and single decision trees.  \n","The **Voting Regressor** provides competitive performance by combining strong learners.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Feature Importance Insights  \n","*(From Random Forest)*\n","\n","| Feature | Importance |\n","|-------|-----------|\n","| Delivery_person_Ratings | **46.5%** |\n","| Distance | **34.1%** |\n","| Delivery_person_Age | **19.4%** |\n","\n","**Key Insight:**  \n","Delivery time is primarily driven by **driver quality and distance**. Highly rated and experienced drivers complete deliveries faster.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Conclusions\n","\n","### Best Model: **Gradient Boosting Regressor**\n","- Test R²: **0.379**\n","- Test RMSE: **7.39 minutes**\n","- Consistent generalization performance\n","\n","### Key Predictors\n","1. Delivery person rating  \n","2. Distance between locations  \n","3. Delivery person age  \n","\n","### Performance Summary\n","- Predicts delivery time within **±7.4 minutes**\n","- Explains ~**38%** of variance\n","- Non-linear ensemble models significantly outperform linear models\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Business Implications\n","- **Driver quality matters most**\n","- **Distance is the strongest operational constraint**\n","- **Experience improves delivery efficiency**\n","- **Deploy Gradient Boosting or ensemble models**\n","\n","---\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"h1aixsIL_X2-"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## Importing Necessary Library"],"metadata":{"id":"GB-w98bRxvnv"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"metadata":{"id":"O1Xt61HnuSXV","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1772026304680,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":13878,"user":{"displayName":"Nayan Kantode","userId":"04231590621013628409"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["import os\n","import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","import warnings\n","import sklearn\n","from math import radians, sin, cos, sqrt, asin\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler, PowerTransformer, MinMaxScaler\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, LabelEncoder\n","from sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold\n","from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV, StratifiedKFold, RandomizedSearchCV\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression, Ridge, Lasso\n","import xgboost as xg\n","from catboost import CatBoostRegressor\n","from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor, GradientBoostingRegressor,ExtraTreesRegressor,VotingRegressor\n","from sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeRegressor\n","from lightgbm.sklearn import LGBMRegressor\n","from sklearn.metrics import r2_score\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df = pd.read_excel(\"/content/Food Delivery Time Prediction Case Study.xlsx\")"],"metadata":{"id":"i2hHdOAQyUL2","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1772026322760,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":18078,"user":{"displayName":"Nayan Kantode","userId":"04231590621013628409"}}},"execution_count":3,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## STEP 1: DATA UNDERSTANDING\n